									<div class="site-panel__cafeinfo-description" data-js="site-panel__cafeinfo-description">

						<div class="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" id="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" data-js="site-panel__cafeinfo-summary" aria-hidden="true">
							<p>Located on the second floor of Buntrock Commons on the beautiful St. Olaf campus. This room is open to reserve 7 days a week, and weekly dining offerings are served Monday - Friday, 11:00 a.m. - 1:30 p.m.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Kings' Dining Room is the perfect spot to have&nbsp;a delicious, made from scratch meal, whether it is for a business meeting or a gathering of friends and family!</p>
						</div>

